This project was designed with reference to the MIT-licensed dsh-attachments
project by CocoSgt. It uses the same public DeepSeek Harness extension points,
but implements a separate streaming upload, persistence, directory, and remote
preview architecture.

Vendored components (MIT License, Copyright (c) DeepSeek):

- src/client/platform/attachment-rail.tsx — vendored from
  deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness, packages/client/ui-attachment/src/AttachmentRail.tsx,
  commit aa6c361a9 (release dsh 0.1.1-rc.2). Changes: clsx replaced with a
  local helper; CSS-module import dropped (styled structurally by this
  plugin's styles.ts).
- src/client/platform/image-lightbox.tsx and the .dua-lightbox-* rules in
  src/client/styles.ts — vendored from the same repository's
  ImageLightbox.tsx / ImageLightbox.module.css, same commit. Changes: CSS
  module class names renamed to the plugin's dua- namespace.

Upstream source: https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness
(0.1.0-rc.6 and 0.1.1-rc.2 shipped byte-identical files; the rc.2 release
internalized these atoms behind its slot-registered plugin, which prompted
this vendoring so the plugin works on both rc lines).
